5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need a structure that doesn't alienate newcomers or make people feel judged. Let's look at the taster forms and the sign-up records.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I agree we need logic here. I'm concerned about the administrative load. I'll check the treasurer's logged hours and the bank statements.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,It feels like a few people do everything. I want to see the tally of sign-in sheets and the rota against attendance.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,The vibe has changed lately. I'll look into the weekday turnout since summer and the quieter members at the winter social.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Takumi,,We can't just guess the numbers again. I'm looking at the ledger of outgoings and the bank statements on renewals.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, do you think the administrative side is that bad?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"It often is the silent killer of clubs, Asuka. Efficiency is key to sustainability.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shunichi, do you think the attendance patterns are affecting the mood?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"Exactly. If people are hesitating to show up, the fee structure might be the culprit.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Takumi,,I just want to know what we actually owe before we decide how to charge.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
